# Additional Grant for Individuals

As an additional permission — and notwithstanding the "Noncommercial Purposes"
limitation above — the licensor grants any **individual** (a natural person) a
license to use the software free of charge for that person's own purposes,
**including paid freelance, contract, consulting, or one-off client work that
the individual performs personally.**

This additional permission is limited to individuals acting on their own behalf.
It does **not** grant any license to a company or other organization, to use for
the internal business operations of a company, or to deploy the software across
an organization's personnel — those uses require a Commercial License (below).

For clarity, this Additional Grant only adds to the rights granted above; it
never removes any of them.

